  "bio": "Marie Gribouillis is an emerging tattoo artist based in Abbeville, France, known for her unique illustrative and watercolor styles with a vegan touch. At Oddzi Tattoo Studio, her charming and colorful designs delight clients, while her dedication to vegan tattooing practices highlights her commitment to ethical choices within the craft. Reach out to Marie for a tattoo experience that is as conscientious as it is beautiful.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Abbeville, Hauts-de-france, France"
